  - question: "Onar\u0131m ne kadar s\xFCrer?"
    answer: "S\u0131va ve boya, bir haftada biter. Aileler evine d\xF6ner."
  approvedLine: "\xC7ad\u0131rdakiler eve d\xF6ner, sa\u011F olun."
